    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ever since that fateful day every year handfuls of dice have found themselves in state sponsored broadcasted competitions. You and up to 3 other players enter the ring and fight. One special thing separating this battle from your average physics fight is that jumping does not push you up, but instead as a die you are rolled down and achieve airtime as a result of the rebound force. Use your fist and any of the 12 items you can find to knock your opponents off the stage and win the right to life and a large profit. These dice have been waiting for the day their luck dries up, will that day be today?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 - 4 local multiplayer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >27 levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character Customization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advanced Gameplay Customization</p></li></ul>",
